	You may want to rename the 'data' field to 'session_data' as
	'data' appears to be a reserved word for one or more of the following:
		ANSI SQL
		IBM DB2
		MS SQL Server
		Postgres
		SAP

	If you do, then execute:

		ADODB_Session::dataFieldName('session_data');

